mutation apply the new interpretation immediately after revision change
detects NoRearContamination
only control
- Revoke(next) == /\ wanted' = next
-                 /\ active' = None
+ Revoke(next) == /\ wanted' = next
+                 /\ active' = IF next.rev # wanted.rev THEN next ELSE None

mutation rearm after device FIFO flush before the playback boundary
detects NoRearContamination
only control
- /\ boundary /\ LocalDrained
+ /\ LocalDrained

mutation accept a stale lease acknowledgement
detects NoStaleAcknowledgement
only control
- THEN ack ELSE producer
+ THEN ack ELSE ack
